      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The coven and its witches practiced a magic that communed with ancestors
    and spirits of the realm of Jatte.  Eleth, now desperate and in a corner, has
    found a way to harness these souls for a further gain, increasing her power.
    \n\r\nWith these souls, Eleth can alter and increase her abilities and potential,
    allowing her to utilize her adversaries own life force for different means, such
    as violent eruptions, stronger control, or even pushing them further beyond their
    limit temporarily. Many things are possible, so long as she is able to harvest
    enough energy from those around her.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0176b88d269b93448a5b252f23e67896, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 7018707494337061761, guid: 0176b88d269b93448a5b252f23e67896, type: 2}
