  m_text: Sometimes when an individual of particularly strong spirit passes away,
    they leave behind a large fragment of their soul, unstable as it is. With her
    training, Eleth is able to see these soul fractures and utilize them for her
    own gains, enhancing her abilities further. With everything around her constantly
    trying to kill her, she'll need every advantage possible.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
