  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Nature has taken over these vessels, after the human hosts in life seemed
    to worship the trees throughout this underground location as some sort of super-natural
    force. These worshipers gave their bodies over to the plants that now inhabit
    their forms, controlling their every movement. Step on anything that these new
    Dryads control, and there presence will be alerted, not taking kindly to trespassers.
    Their magic seems to also be able to leap from their hands in a sort of magic
    blast, so closing distance with these thin and lithe creatures seems to be the
    best option for dealing with them now.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0176b88d269b93448a5b252f23e67896, type: 2}
