      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'His special purple crystals grants him a bit more control over his own
    actions than most other enemies around, making him more dangerous and able to
    influence smaller enemies around him. The goblins of his arena follow his every
    command, ready to jump anyone that steps foot in their temple.


    These extra
    strong crystals are able to contain this special Ogre''s free-thinking, and block
    out soul magic. With enough damage though, perhaps you could crack into this
    one just like any other enemy. Act quick though, it''s said those crystals can
    repair their own damage if left unattended for too long.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0176b88d269b93448a5b252f23e67896, type: 2}
