      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Big and mean, the burly brute is low on three things: intelligence, speed,
    and patience. Get too close, and that club, fashioned straight from the trunk
    of a tree, will be moving much faster than any tree should be able to: very fast.
    Make sure to stay out of reach, or move quick once you are within, otherwise
    the next patch of redwood will be you.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
