  m_text: These armored men are some of the few human presence here in underground.
    While you would think there may be some humanity in them, that's where you would
    be mistaken. These torturers are just as cruel as the ones who put you here,
    just with less knowledge. Don't let this fool you though, they are tough to crack,
    and that spear is certainly sharp. Nobody wants to be on their list of misbehaving
    inmates. Unfortunately, you're at the top of said list.
